{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03135","headline":"奉使自蓝田玉山南行 · 张九龄","name":"奉使自蓝田玉山南行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征骖入云壑，始忆步金门。\n通籍微躯幸，归途明主恩。\n匪唯徇行役，兼得慰晨昏。\n是节暑云炽，纷吾心所尊。\n海县且悠缅，山邮日骏奔。\n徒知恶嚣事，未暇息阴论。\n嶢武经陈迹，衡湘指故园。\n水闻南涧险，烟望北林繁。\n远霭千岩合，幽声百籁喧。\n阴泉夏犹冻，阳景昼方暾。\n懿此高深极，徒令梦想存。\n盛明期有报，长往复奚言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}